/// - `VsanIscsiTargetSystem::vsan_vit_get_iscsi_lun().object_information?`
/// - `VsanIscsiTargetSystem::vsan_vit_get_iscsi_lu_ns().object_information?`
/// - `VsanIscsiTargetSystem::vsan_vit_get_iscsi_target().object_information?`
/// - `VsanIscsiTargetSystem::vsan_vit_get_iscsi_targets().object_information?`
/// - `VsanVcClusterHealthSystem::vsan_query_vc_cluster_health_summary().perfsvc_health?.stats_object_info?`
/// - `VsanVcClusterHealthSystem::vsan_query_cluster_historical_health().perfsvc_health?.stats_object_info?`
/// - `DataProtectionHealthSystem::vsan_query_health_summary().perfsvc_health?.stats_object_info?`
