/// - `HostProfileManager::generate_config_task_list(config_spec).storage_device?.multipath_info?.lun?[*].path[*]`
/// - `HostProfileManager::generate_host_profile_task_list_task(config_spec).storage_device?.multipath_info?.lun?[*].path[*]`
/// - `HostProfile::execute_host_profile().config_spec?.storage_device?.multipath_info?.lun?[*].path[*]`
/// - `HostProfileManager::generate_config_task_list().config_spec?.storage_device?.multipath_info?.lun?[*].path[*]`
