/// - `ClusterComputeResource::action_history.action→ClusterClusterInitialPlacementAction.config_spec?.files?`
/// - `ClusterComputeResource::recommendation.action?[*]→ClusterClusterInitialPlacementAction.config_spec?.files?`
/// - `VirtualMachineSnapshot::config.files`
/// - `VirtualMachine::reconfig_vm_task(spec).files?`
/// - `VirtualMachine::clone_vm_task(spec).config?.files?`
/// - `HostSystem::query_memory_overhead_ex(vm_config_info).files`
/// - `Folder::create_vm_task(config).files?`
