/// - `VsanVcClusterHealthSystem::vsan_query_vc_cluster_health_summary().hcl_info?.host_results?[*].controllers?[*].drivers_on_hcl?[*]`
/// - `VsanVcClusterHealthSystem::vsan_query_cluster_historical_health().hcl_info?.host_results?[*].controllers?[*].drivers_on_hcl?[*]`
