/// - `ClusterComputeResource::configuration_ex→ClusterConfigInfoEx.vsan_host_config?[*]→VsanHostConfigInfoEx.internal_extended_config?`
/// - `HostVsanSystem::config→VsanHostConfigInfoEx.internal_extended_config?`
/// - `Folder::create_cluster_ex(spec).vsan_host_config_spec?[*]→VsanHostConfigInfoEx.internal_extended_config?`
/// - `Folder::add_standalone_host_task(comp_res_spec)→ClusterConfigSpecEx.vsan_host_config_spec?[*]→VsanHostConfigInfoEx.internal_extended_config?`
